# What never enters a build context.
#
# The first three lines are about correctness rather than image size: the
# Dockerfiles install with `--frozen-lockfile` inside the image, and a host
# `node_modules` copied in would shadow that install with whatever happened to
# be on the developer's machine — including binaries built for their CPU.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
.turbo

.git
.github

# Local secrets. Nothing here is committed, and nothing here may be baked into
# a layer either — an image layer is as readable as a file.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Test and tooling output that has no business in a runtime image.
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/coverage
**/*.log
